			</dict>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs access to your contacts to identify and block spam calls, and to provide you with comprehensive caller information.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs access to your microphone to record calls for evidence, enable call quality analysis, and provide speech-to-text features.</string>
	<key>NSPhoneCallUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs access to your phone to identify and block spam calls, screen incoming calls, and provide call analytics.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs camera access for video calls, document scanning, QR code scanning, and profile picture uploads.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses your location to provide region-specific scam alerts and improve call screening accuracy.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses your location to provide real-time scam alerts and location-based protection, even when the app is in the background.</string>
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Use Face ID to securely access your CallDefender account and protect your personal information.</string>
	<key>NSTouchIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Use Touch ID to securely access your CallDefender account and protect your personal information.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs calendar access to schedule important follow-up actions and deadlines related to your complaints and cases.</string>
	<key>NSRemindersUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs reminders access to notify you about important deadlines, court dates, and follow-up actions.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender needs photo library access to let you select profile pictures and upload evidence for complaints.</string>
	<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses motion data to detect when you're in a call and optimize app performance accordingly.</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses health data to detect stress levels during calls and provide wellness insights.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender may update health data to track stress indicators during calls.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses Bluetooth for enhanced device detection and improved call screening accuracy.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
	<string>CallDefender uses Bluetooth for enhanced device detection and improved call screening accuracy.</string>
